# <projectName>

A web application built with the Konvi framework.

## Prerequisites

- **JDK 17 or newer**
- **Gradle** — this project does not ship the Gradle wrapper. Install Gradle on your
  machine (the intended version is pinned in `gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties`).
  With Gradle installed you can run `gradle wrapper` once to generate `./gradlew` if you
  prefer using the wrapper.

## Build

```
gradle build
```

## Run

```
gradle run
```

The entry point is the `main` function in `src/main/kotlin/<packagePath>/Main.kt`, which
starts the server via `startKonvi`. You can also run it directly from your IDE.

## Configuration

App settings live in `src/main/resources/application.yaml` (e.g. the HTTP `port`).
Any setting can be overridden without editing the file, via an environment
variable derived from its config path (uppercased, `.` becomes `_`):

| Setting                        | Environment variable         |
|---------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| `konvi.port`                    | `KONVI_PORT`                  |
| `konvi.database.url`            | `KONVI_DATABASE_URL`          |
| `konvi.database.driver`         | `KONVI_DATABASE_DRIVER`       |
| `konvi.database.username`       | `KONVI_DATABASE_USERNAME`     |
| `konvi.database.password`       | `KONVI_DATABASE_PASSWORD`     |
| `konvi.auth.jwt.secret`         | `KONVI_AUTH_JWT_SECRET`       |
| `konvi.auth.jwt.issuer`         | `KONVI_AUTH_JWT_ISSUER`       |
| `konvi.auth.jwt.audience`       | `KONVI_AUTH_JWT_AUDIENCE`     |

Secrets (like the JWT secret and database credentials) should be set via
environment variables in every environment beyond local dev — never commit
them to `application.yaml`.

### Environment

Konvi distinguishes DEVELOPMENT from PRODUCTION via the `KONVI_ENV` environment
variable (`dev`/`development` or `prod`/`production`; defaults to `development`
when unset). In PRODUCTION, Konvi refuses to start if the JWT secret is still
the `change-me` default or the database URL is an in-memory H2 URL — set
`KONVI_ENV=production` once you've configured real values for both.
